{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-ktl-2-dot-2kg-squishy-hot-colour-gorilla-toy-2603-0183","content_id":"8daa3114-4d8e-4b86-a736-dee805371667","description":"Product Recall for KTL 2.2kg Squishy Hot Colour Gorilla Toy presenting a risk to health.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"1749fb6a-a3ae-47ac-a70f-3c34b5a991dd","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-07-31T14:54:57+01:00","id":"1749fb6a-a3ae-47ac-a70f-3c34b5a991dd","title":"Link to Product Image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-07-31T14:54:57+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a6ca9310c36759b5ccaa2eb/2603-0183-product-recall-kandy-toys-squishy-hot-colour-gorilla.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: KTL 2.2kg Squishy Hot Colour Gorilla Toy sold sold via OnBuy</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a risk to health as  the sand-like material inside the toy may be contaminated with a quantity of asbestos.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users by KTL (Kandy Toys). The listing has been removed by the online marketplace (OnBuy).</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Toys - Action Figures (Non Powered)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>KTL (formerly Kandy Toys)</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>KTL Item Number</td>\n      <td>TY3537</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>KTL Barcode</td>\n      <td>5063389048716</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>OnBuy Item Number</td>\n      <td>p-401766627-853879379</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>Unknown</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Stretchy gorilla toys filled with sand-like material.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_1749fb6a-a3ae-47ac-a70f-3c34b5a991dd\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a6ca9310c36759b5ccaa2eb/2603-0183-product-recall-kandy-toys-squishy-hot-colour-gorilla.pdf\">Link to Product Image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a risk to health as the sand-like material inside the toy may be contaminated with a small quantity of asbestos. Asbestos is a banned substance because it poses a risk to health even at low levels of exposure.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Toys (Safety) Regulations 2011.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been withdrawn from the market and recalled from end users by KTL (Kandy Toys). The listing has been removed by OnBuy.</p>\n\n<p>We recommend owners stop using this product immediately and keep it out of the reach of children. Follow the below instructions for details on disposal and return of the product.</p>\n\n<p>For further information, access the KTL website at:  <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://kandytoys.co.uk/recall-information\">https://kandytoys.co.uk/recall-information</a> or call customer service on 01395 234600.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"disposal-instructions\">Disposal instructions:</h3>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>Stop using the product immediately.</li>\n  <li>If the sand is still in its packaging, place in a heavy-duty plastic bag, double tape it securely, label it clearly and store in a secure location out of the reach of children.</li>\n  <li>If the sand has been used, clean up sites where the product was used using wet cloths to avoid generating dust. Wear gloves and a mask. Double bag the sand, gloves, mask and cloths.</li>\n  <li>Keep children and other people away from areas where the sand has been used until the area has been cleaned.</li>\n  <li>Return the product to store where specified by the retailer for a full refund.</li>\n  <li>If you are unable to return the product to the retailer, follow the steps above and contact your local authority / access their website for guidance on safe disposal of asbestos in your area.</li>\n  <li>For further information, please contact the retailer or visit the <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/asbestos-in-consumer-products\">GOV.uk page on asbestos in consumer products</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD case number: 2603-0183</p>\n\n<p>Lead Authority: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"Addition of OnBuy, Debenhams and Howley's Toys. ","public_timestamp":"2026-07-09T13:52:20Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-03-18T19:21:57Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"disposal-instructions","level":3,"text":"Disposal instructions:"},{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"toys","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users","removal-of-listing-by-online-marketplace","withdrawal-of-product-from-market"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-03-18","product_risk_level":"not-provided"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-03-18T19:21:58+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-ktl-2-dot-2kg-squishy-hot-colour-gorilla-toy-2603-0183","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-ktl-2-dot-2kg-squishy-hot-colour-gorilla-toy-2603-0183","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/